{
  "id": "network-quic",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/answer.txt",
    "contains": "5c8a3f1e2b4d"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: разбор QUIC-дамапа\n\nДан `q.pcap` — UDP-трафик на порт 443. Это QUIC (HTTP/3).\n\n1. Посмотри типы QUIC-пакетов: `tshark -r q.pcap -Y quic -T fields -e quic.long.packet_type`\n   (0 = Initial, 2 = Handshake).\n2. Initial-пакет клиента несёт Destination Connection ID (DCID) — по нему\n   сервер идентифицирует соединение. Достань DCID:\n   `tshark -r q.pcap -Y 'quic.long.packet_type==0' -T fields -e quic.dcid`\n3. Запиши DCID из клиентского Initial в `answer.txt` и набери `check`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/q.pcap",
      "b64": ""
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "tshark": {
      "help": "tshark [опции] -r <pcap> [-Y фильтр] [-T fields -e поле]",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "quic\\.long\\.packet_type==0.*quic\\.dcid",
          "example": "-Y 'quic.long.packet_type==0' -T fields -e quic.dcid",
          "output": "5c8a3f1e2b4d\n5c8a3f1e2b4d\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "-e quic\\.dcid",
          "example": "-Y quic -T fields -e quic.dcid",
          "output": "5c8a3f1e2b4d\n5c8a3f1e2b4d\naabbccdd\naabbccdd\naabbccdd\naabbccdd\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "-e quic\\.long\\.packet_type",
          "example": "-Y quic -T fields -e quic.long.packet_type",
          "output": "0\n0\n2\n2\n2\n2\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "-e quic\\.version",
          "example": "-Y quic.version -T fields -e quic.version",
          "output": "0x00000001\n0x00000001\n0x00000001\n0x00000001\n0x00000001\n0x00000001\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "io,phs",
          "example": "-q -z io,phs",
          "output": "\n===================================================================\nProtocol Hierarchy Statistics\nFilter: \n\nframe                                    frames:26 bytes:4370\n  raw                                    frames:26 bytes:4370\n    ip                                   frames:26 bytes:4370\n      udp                                frames:26 bytes:4370\n        quic                             frames:26 bytes:4370\n===================================================================\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "quic",
          "example": "",
          "output": "\n===================================================================\nProtocol Hierarchy Statistics\nFilter: \n\nframe                                    frames:26 bytes:4370\n  raw                                    frames:26 bytes:4370\n    ip                                   frames:26 bytes:4370\n      udp                                frames:26 bytes:4370\n        quic                             frames:26 bytes:4370\n===================================================================\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}